  fhir:purpose [ fhir:v "This value set was defined to support the set of event statuses in FHIR that do not explicitly indicate a negative status (i.e. all the codes from the http://hl7.org/fhir/event-status code system that are used for immunization status and that are not `not-done`)."] ; # 
